.SH "نام (NAME)"
opensc-asn1 \- parse ASN\&.1 data
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBopensc\-asn1\fR\ 'u
\fBopensc\-asn1\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIFILES\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The
\fBopensc\-asn1\fR
utility is used to parse ASN\&.1 data\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
.PP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR
.RS 4
Print help and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR, \fB\-V\fR
